            {"label": "NHP cohort", "value": "Royal Preston not in NHP 40-hospitals — sustains existing-site capitalisation profile"},
            {"label": "Capital programme context", "value": "Active EPR module additions sustain intangible-asset additions; specialty-systems imaging refresh"},
            {"label": "Funding trajectory", "value": "2021-22 c. £1.8M → 2023-24 c. £2.2M → 2024-25 £2.364M — sustained Frontline Digitisation cohort spend"},
